<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav November retail sales down 2.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav November retail sales down 2.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV RETAIL SALES	NOV 96	 OCT 96	  NOV 95</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	  -   2.0	+  11.0	   N.A.</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    +  87.0	+ 103.0	   N.A.</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO NOV)</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    +  99.0	+ 102.0	   N.A.</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exclude private sector. Data cover Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Gordana Filipovic, Belgrade newsroom, +381 11 222 4254</p>
